  "body": "OPEN HOME | Saturday and Sunday | 12:30pm - 1pm\r\n\r\nSecure Your Castor Bay Summer NOW – $3,795,000!\r\n\r\nWith a CV of $3.85m, CCC and freehold title now issued, this substantial new Castor Bay residence is ready for its next chapter. Now priced at $3,795,000, below its CV, the owners have made their intentions clear, presenting a compelling opportunity to secure an exceptional coastal home in time to enjoy everything a Castor Bay summer has to offer.\r\n\r\nDesigned across three generous levels, five bedrooms each with their own ensuite combine with multiple living spaces and a dedicated office to deliver outstanding flexibility for families and guests. A private lift connects every floor, while air conditioning ensures year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the designer kitchen features premium NEFF appliances with both gas and induction cooking. Living and dining areas open to sunny entertaining decks and landscaped gardens, while a separate formal lounge with a double-sided gas fireplace offers an inviting retreat.\r\n\r\nThe upper-level master suite captures expansive Hauraki Gulf views, complemented by a generous walk-in wardrobe and beautifully appointed ensuite. Triple garaging, additional off-street parking and electric gates complete this impressive coastal address.\r\n\r\nSpace, views and the ease of a brand-new home, all within sought-after school zones, including both Westlake schools.\r\n\r\nMake your next move. Contact Nicky or Matt to arrange a viewing and discuss your offer.",
